     "Lay the lid face down on a cloth. (1) Seat the acrylic window in the 24 × 13 mm opening (a little glue is the suggestion; confirm on the prototype). (2) Rest the OLED on the 4 posts of the ceiling, glass towards the window, and fix it with the 4 thread-forming M2 × 4 screws: turn until it seats, no more. (3) Plug the Qwiic cable into the module and leave it slack in an S (about 25 mm of wire spare); it joins the board only in step 9. (4) Seat the speaker under the lid's slots and cover it with the L-shaped acoustic box (about 10 cm³), which must be airtight: seal the wire hole with silicone.",
